                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ⟩
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \langle u, v + w \rangle = \langle u, v \rangle + \langle u, w\rangle
          .proof
            %h6#proof Proof
            %p
              All but the last of these is a simple deduction from the formulae. The last is as well, but takes a little work to get it in the correct form. We multiply by
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn 4
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 4
              to simplify the notation.
